<div class="card">
    <h2>Step 2: Alcohol Use (AUDIT)</h2>
    <p class="form-hint">
        Ten-item AUDIT screening (WHO). Q1&ndash;Q8 scored 0&ndash;4; Q9 and Q10
        scored 0, 2, or 4. Total range 0&ndash;40.
    </p>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="audit_q1_frequency">1. How often do you have a drink containing alcohol?</label>
        <select id="audit_q1_frequency" name="alcohol_use_audit.audit_q1_frequency">
            <option value="0" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ1Frequency == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 &mdash; Never</option>
            <option value="1" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ1Frequency == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 &mdash; Monthly or less</option>
            <option value="2" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ1Frequency == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; 2-4 times a month</option>
            <option value="3" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ1Frequency == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 &mdash; 2-3 times a week</option>
            <option value="4" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ1Frequency == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; 4+ times a week</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="audit_q2_typical_quantity">2. How many drinks on a typical drinking day?</label>
        <select id="audit_q2_typical_quantity" name="alcohol_use_audit.audit_q2_typical_quantity">
            <option value="0" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ2TypicalQuantity == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 &mdash; 1 or 2</option>
            <option value="1" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ2TypicalQuantity == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 &mdash; 3 or 4</option>
            <option value="2" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ2TypicalQuantity == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; 5 or 6</option>
            <option value="3" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ2TypicalQuantity == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 &mdash; 7 to 9</option>
            <option value="4" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ2TypicalQuantity == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; 10 or more</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="audit_q3_binge_frequency">3. How often six or more drinks on one occasion?</label>
        <select id="audit_q3_binge_frequency" name="alcohol_use_audit.audit_q3_binge_frequency">
            <option value="0" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ3BingeFrequency == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 &mdash; Never</option>
            <option value="1" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ3BingeFrequency == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 &mdash; Less than monthly</option>
            <option value="2" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ3BingeFrequency == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; Monthly</option>
            <option value="3" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ3BingeFrequency == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 &mdash; Weekly</option>
            <option value="4" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ3BingeFrequency == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; Daily or almost daily</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="audit_q4_impaired_control">4. In the last year, how often unable to stop drinking once started?</label>
        <select id="audit_q4_impaired_control" name="alcohol_use_audit.audit_q4_impaired_control">
            <option value="0" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ4ImpairedControl == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 &mdash; Never</option>
            <option value="1" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ4ImpairedControl == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 &mdash; Less than monthly</option>
            <option value="2" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ4ImpairedControl == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; Monthly</option>
            <option value="3" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ4ImpairedControl == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 &mdash; Weekly</option>
            <option value="4" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ4ImpairedControl == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; Daily or almost daily</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="audit_q5_failed_expectations">5. In the last year, how often failed to do what was expected because of drinking?</label>
        <select id="audit_q5_failed_expectations" name="alcohol_use_audit.audit_q5_failed_expectations">
            <option value="0" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ5FailedExpectations == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 &mdash; Never</option>
            <option value="1" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ5FailedExpectations == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 &mdash; Less than monthly</option>
            <option value="2" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ5FailedExpectations == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; Monthly</option>
            <option value="3" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ5FailedExpectations == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 &mdash; Weekly</option>
            <option value="4" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ5FailedExpectations == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; Daily or almost daily</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="audit_q6_morning_drinking">6. In the last year, how often needed a first drink in the morning?</label>
        <select id="audit_q6_morning_drinking" name="alcohol_use_audit.audit_q6_morning_drinking">
            <option value="0" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ6MorningDrinking == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 &mdash; Never</option>
            <option value="1" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ6MorningDrinking == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 &mdash; Less than monthly</option>
            <option value="2" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ6MorningDrinking == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; Monthly</option>
            <option value="3" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ6MorningDrinking == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 &mdash; Weekly</option>
            <option value="4" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ6MorningDrinking == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; Daily or almost daily</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="audit_q7_guilt">7. In the last year, how often felt guilt or remorse after drinking?</label>
        <select id="audit_q7_guilt" name="alcohol_use_audit.audit_q7_guilt">
            <option value="0" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ7Guilt == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 &mdash; Never</option>
            <option value="1" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ7Guilt == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 &mdash; Less than monthly</option>
            <option value="2" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ7Guilt == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; Monthly</option>
            <option value="3" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ7Guilt == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 &mdash; Weekly</option>
            <option value="4" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ7Guilt == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; Daily or almost daily</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="audit_q8_blackout">8. In the last year, how often unable to remember the night before because of drinking?</label>
        <select id="audit_q8_blackout" name="alcohol_use_audit.audit_q8_blackout">
            <option value="0" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ8Blackout == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 &mdash; Never</option>
            <option value="1" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ8Blackout == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 &mdash; Less than monthly</option>
            <option value="2" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ8Blackout == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; Monthly</option>
            <option value="3" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ8Blackout == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 &mdash; Weekly</option>
            <option value="4" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ8Blackout == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; Daily or almost daily</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="audit_q9_injury">9. Have you or someone else been injured because of your drinking?</label>
        <select id="audit_q9_injury" name="alcohol_use_audit.audit_q9_injury">
            <option value="0" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ9Injury == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 &mdash; No</option>
            <option value="2" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ9Injury == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; Yes, but not in the last year</option>
            <option value="4" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ9Injury == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; Yes, in the last year</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="audit_q10_concern">10. Has anyone been concerned about your drinking or suggested you cut down?</label>
        <select id="audit_q10_concern" name="alcohol_use_audit.audit_q10_concern">
            <option value="0" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ10Concern == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 &mdash; No</option>
            <option value="2" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ10Concern == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; Yes, but not in the last year</option>
            <option value="4" {% if alcohol_use_audit.auditQ10Concern == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; Yes, in the last year</option>
        </select>
    </div>
</div>
